    "/api/category-product/glass": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Catalog"
        ],
        "summary": "Category Product",
        "description": "Get Product with Pagination  \nQuery Parameters:  \nperPage (optional):  \nThe number of products to display per page.\n\nDefault: 15  \nExample: perPage=10  \nsort (optional):  \nThe sorting option for the products. Choose one of the following values:\n\nlow-to-high: Sort products by price in ascending order.\n\nhigh-to-low: Sort products by price in descending order.\n\ntop-selling: Sort products by top-selling rank (descending).\n\nlatest: Sort products by their creation date in descending order (default).\n\nExample: sort=low-to-high\n\npage (optional):  \nThe page number for pagination.\n\nDefault: 1  \nExample: page=2  \nEg:  \n?perPage=20&sort=high-to-low&page=2\n\nwithout Auth ad_price will be null",
