                        "webcategories": [],
                        "product_description": "<p>Delta 9 &amp; CBD 1:1 Gummies are easily the most mouthwatering way to get a generous dose of two of the most powerful cannabinoids. These delicious treats will add a whole new level of enjoyment to your experience.</p>\r\n<p>Modus Delta 9 &amp; CBD 1:1 Gummies contain an equal amount of delta 9 THC and cannabidiol (CBD). Each gummy delivers 10mg of Delta 9 and 10mg of CBD into your bloodstream. These gummies also come in an array of delicious fruity flavors, including Mango, Lychee, Guava, Sour Apple, Blue Sour Razz, Sour Strawberry, Strawberry, Grape, and Watermelon.</p>\r\n<p>Our Delta 9 &amp; CBD Gummies are made with premium quality ingredients in a state-of-the-art facility. All our products are tested by a third-party laboratory to guarantee their purity and potency.</p>"
                      },
