                    "dpp_inc_tax": "38.0000",
                    "profit_percent": "0.0000",
                    "default_sell_price": "40.0000",
                    "sell_price_inc_tax": "40.0000",
                    "created_at": "2025-01-17T06:25:04.000000Z",
                    "updated_at": "2025-02-01T14:54:42.000000Z",
                    "deleted_at": null,
                    "combo_variations": null,
                    "var_barcode_no": "942411010257",
                    "var_maxSaleLimit": null,
                    "var_img_url": null,
                    "product": {
                      "id": 524,
                      "name": "KADO BAR ICE + NIC CONTROL 5% DISPOSABLE (120ML) 40K PUFFS 5CT/ BOX",
                      "business_id": 1,
                      "type": "variable",
                      "unit_id": 1,
                      "secondary_unit_id": null,
                      "sub_unit_ids": null,
                      "brand_id": 1122,
                      "category_id": 74,
                      "sub_category_id": 78,
                      "tax": null,
                      "tax_type": "exclusive",
                      "enable_stock": 1,
                      "alert_quantity": null,
                      "sku": "KADOBAR40KDIS",
                      "barcode_type": "C128",
                      "expiry_period": null,
                      "expiry_period_type": null,
                      "enable_sr_no": 0,
                      "weight": null,
                      "product_custom_field1": null,
                      "product_custom_field2": null,
                      "product_custom_field3": null,
                      "product_custom_field4": null,
                      "product_custom_field5": null,
                      "product_custom_field6": null,
                      "product_custom_field7": null,
                      "product_custom_field8": null,
                      "product_custom_field9": null,
                      "product_custom_field10": null,
                      "product_custom_field11": null,
                      "product_custom_field12": null,
                      "product_custom_field13": null,
                      "product_custom_field14": null,
                      "product_custom_field15": null,
                      "product_custom_field16": null,
                      "product_custom_field17": null,
                      "product_custom_field18": null,
                      "product_custom_field19": null,
                      "product_custom_field20": null,
                      "image": "2025-02-01-KADOBAR40KDIS01.jpg",
                      "woocommerce_media_id": null,
                      "product_description": "<strong>KADO BAR ICE + NIC CONTROL 5% DISPOSABLE (120ML) 40K PUFFS 5CT/ BOX</strong>\r\n<h1><strong> Description</strong></h1>\r\nTake your vaping experience to the next level with the <strong>Kado Bar Ice + Nic Control 5% Disposable</strong>! Designed for enthusiasts who demand premium quality and long-lasting performance, this 120ML disposable delivers an impressive 40,000 puffs, making it one of the most durable and convenient options on the market. With <strong>Nic Control</strong>, you can enjoy a smooth and satisfying hit every time. Available in an array of tantalizing flavors, this 5ct box is perfect for retailers or individuals looking to stock up on premium disposables.\r\n<h1><strong>Key Features</strong></h1>\r\n<ol>\r\n \t<li><strong>Massive 40,000 Puffs</strong>: Enjoy extended vaping sessions without frequent replacements.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>5% Nicotine Strength</strong>: Provides a smooth, flavorful experience for every puff.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Nic Control Technology</strong>: Ensures consistent flavor and performance throughout the device’s lifespan.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>120ML Capacity</strong>: Packed with ample e-liquid for longer usage.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Portable and User-Friendly</strong>: Compact design makes it perfect for on-the-go vaping.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>5ct Display Box</strong>: Great for retail presentation or bulk personal use.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Wide Flavor Selection</strong>: Choose from an extensive lineup of delicious options to suit every palate.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h1><strong>Available Flavors</strong></h1>\r\nExplore a variety of mouthwatering flavors to enhance your vaping experience:\r\n<ol>\r\n \t<li><strong>Peach Ice</strong>: Sweet, juicy peach with a cool menthol twist.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Strawberry Banana</strong>: A creamy blend of ripe strawberries and sweet bananas.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Chilled Aloe Mango</strong>: Tropical mango paired with refreshing aloe and icy undertones.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Blueberry Watermelon</strong>: A fruity fusion of tart blueberries and sweet watermelon.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Grape Ice</strong>: Classic grape flavor with an icy finish.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Cherry Hard Candy</strong>: Sweet and tangy cherry with a candy-like essence.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Blue Raz Ice</strong>: Tangy blue raspberry with a chilling menthol kick.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Watermelon Ice</strong>: Juicy watermelon paired with a frosty exhale.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Strawberry Watermelon</strong>: A delightful mix of two summer favorites.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Pineapple Ice</strong>: Tropical pineapple enhanced with a refreshing icy layer.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Bomb Pop</strong>: A nostalgic, fruity popsicle flavor that’s sure to please.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Chilled Red Apple</strong>: Crisp red apple with a cooling menthol sensation.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Meta Moon</strong>: A mysterious, fruity blend with celestial sweetness.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Simply Mint</strong>: Clean and refreshing mint flavor for a straightforward vape.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>The Real Miami Mint</strong>: A bold, refreshing mint that delivers a true Miami vibe.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h1><strong>Conclusion</strong></h1>\r\nThe <strong>Kado Bar Ice + Nic Control 5% Disposable</strong> is the ultimate choice for vapers seeking durability, convenience, and exceptional flavor. With up to 40,000 puffs, a 120ML capacity, and innovative Nic Control technology, this device redefines vaping satisfaction. Choose from a diverse range of flavors, from fruity favorites to icy classics, and enjoy the premium quality that Kado Bar is known for. Whether for personal use or retail, this 5ct box is a must-have for any vape enthusiast\r\n\r\n&nbsp;",
                      "created_by": 1,
